          "fill": "$fg",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "A redesign of the Textual-based RAG dashboard. The daemon (FastAPI + Qdrant + Ollama) serves a read-only HTTP TUI client. The new design replaces tabbed navigation with a persistent sidebar, a top status bar with daemon vitals, and a REPL-style command line at the bottom usable from any screen. A right-side rail surfaces recent hits for fast back-navigation across all surfaces.",
