          "content": "FILTERS — pill-shaped chips grouped by category (Language, Concurrency, Pattern). Active = filled with teal border. Slider for complexity threshold with live hit count. Strategy radio overrides the planner's auto choice. Bottom command line accepts inline filter DSL (`:filter lang:py is_composable`) for keyboard-only workflows.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$sans",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
